  "description": "TCP socket handling, TPKT (RFC 1006) framing, COTP (ISO 8073 class 0) connect/data PDUs -- operates over the abstract duplex byte stream supplied by Iec61850.Security (plaintext or TLS per IEC 62351-3); Transport itself never touches socket/TLS setup directly, it just consumes whatever stream Security hands it.",
